### BullModuleAsyncOptions

Source: https://github.com/nestjs/bull/blob/master/_autodocs/types.md

Options for registering a Bull queue asynchronously via BullModule.registerQueueAsync. Extends Pick<ModuleMetadata, 'imports'> and includes factory providers.

```APIDOC
## BullModuleAsyncOptions

### Description
Options for registering a Bull queue asynchronously via `BullModule.registerQueueAsync`. Extends `Pick<ModuleMetadata, 'imports'>` and includes factory providers.

### Interface
```ts
export interface BullModuleAsyncOptions extends Pick<ModuleMetadata, 'imports'> {
  name?: string;                                    // @default default
  configKey?: string;
  useExisting?: Type<BullOptionsFactory>;
  useClass?: Type<BullOptionsFactory>;
  useFactory?: (...args: any[]) => Promise<BullModuleOptions> | BullModuleOptions;
  inject?: FactoryProvider['inject'];
  extraProviders?: Provider[];
}
```

### Fields
- **imports** (`ModuleMetadata['imports']` i.e. `Array<Type<any> | DynamicModule | Promise<DynamicModule> | ForwardReference>`) - Optional - Modules imported into the returned module.
- **name** (`string`) - Optional - Default: `'default'` - As in `BullModuleOptions`.
- **configKey** (`string`) - Optional - As in `BullModuleOptions`.
- **useExisting** (`Type<BullOptionsFactory>`) - Optional - Existing provider to reuse.
- **useClass** (`Type<BullOptionsFactory>`) - Optional - Provider instantiated and injected into the factory.
- **useFactory** (`(...args: any[]) => Promise<BullModuleOptions> | BullModuleOptions`) - Optional - Factory; `inject` args are appended after the shared-config holder.
- **inject** (`FactoryProvider['inject']` i.e. `any[]`) - Optional - Tokens injected into `useFactory`.
- **extraProviders** (`Provider[]`) - Optional - Additional providers registered in the returned module.
